flowchart TD
  Boot[Boot ESP32] --> InitSerial[Initialiser Serial]
  InitSerial --> InitOLED[Initialiser OLED]
  InitOLED --> LoadPrefs["Charger Preferences (ssid, pass, kfactor)"]
  LoadPrefs --> HasSSID{SSID connu?}
  
  HasSSID -- oui --> Connect[Tentative de connexion WiFi]
  HasSSID -- non --> StartAP[Demarrer AP Pinty]
  
  Connect -- succes --> NormalMode[Mode Normal]
  Connect -- echec --> StartAP

  StartAP --> APWait["Serveur config (/ , /save , /reset)"]
  APWait --> Save{Form soumis?}
  Save -- save --> Restart[Enregistrer prefs & restart]
  Save -- reset --> ResetTotal[Remet totalLitres a 0]

  NormalMode --> AttachInt[Attach interruption capteur]
  AttachInt --> Loop[Loop principal]

  subgraph LoopCycle [Boucle principale]
    Loop --> EverySecond[Chaque seconde: calcul debit & total]
    EverySecond --> UpdateOLED["MAJ ecran: wifi, api, buffer, debit, total"]
    EverySecond --> BufferIfOffline{Wifi connecte?}
    BufferIfOffline -- non --> AddBuffer[Ajouter datapoint au buffer]
    BufferIfOffline -- oui --> NoBuffer[Pas de buffer]
    Loop --> PeriodicSend[Si sendInterval ecoule -> envoi]
    PeriodicSend --> SendDecision{Buffer présent?}
    SendDecision -- oui --> SendBuffer[POST batch -> vider buffer si OK]
    SendDecision -- non --> SendNow[POST courant -> set sendStatus OK/ERR]
  end

  Loop --> ReconnectTimer[Tenter reconnexion toutes les reconnectInterval]
  ReconnectTimer --> TryReconnect{Reconnect success?}
  TryReconnect -- oui --> OnReconnect[Wifi OK -> envoyer buffer si présent]
  TryReconnect -- non --> KeepAP[Conserver AP actif; continuer tentatives]

  SendNow --> UpdateStatus[sendStatus = OK/ERR/PENDING/WAIT]
  SendBuffer --> UpdateStatus2[sendStatus = OK/ERR]
  AddBuffer --> UpdateStatus3[API: WAIT en attente de réseau]

  ResetTotal --> UpdateOLED
  Restart --> Boot

  style StartAP fill:#f9f,stroke:#333,stroke-width:1px
  style NormalMode fill:#9f9,stroke:#333,stroke-width:1px
  style LoopCycle fill:#eef,stroke:#333,stroke-width:1px